BT 38.507 422.105 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(01)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 422.105 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(This admit card will be applicable for preliminary test, written examination and viva voce.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 409.948 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(02)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 409.948 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant must carry this admit card during every examination.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 397.790 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(03)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 397.790 Td 0.350 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant must sit in the examination hall at least 30 minutes prior to preliminary test and 15 minutes prior to written examination. On the day of Preliminary )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 388.633 Td 0.000 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(test, it is forbidden to leave the hall before the test ends.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 376.475 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(04)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 376.475 Td 1.177 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant is prohibited from bringing books, bag, mobile phone or any other type of communication device. Applicant is not allowed to use any type of )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 367.318 Td 0.000 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(calculator in Preliminary Test but allowed to use non-scientific calculator in written exam.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 355.160 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(05)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 355.160 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant must use the same signature for application, attendance sheet and answer script.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 343.003 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(06)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 343.003 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant will not be allowed entry in the examination hall after distribution of the question paper for preliminary test.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 330.845 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(07)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 330.845 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant must use black ink ball point pen to fill up all parts and circles of preliminary test answer sheet and top sheet of written answer script.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 318.688 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(08)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 318.688 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant is barred from entering the examination hall 15 minutes after the written examination starts.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 306.530 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(09)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 306.530 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant must report at least 30 minutes before the scheduled time for viva voce.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 294.373 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(10)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 294.373 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(In addition to his/her educational qualification and experience, an applicant must produce original copies of all necessary documents before the Viva Board.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 282.215 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(11)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 282.215 Td 1.298 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Invigilators in the examination hall will match the photograph of the applicant in the attendance sheet with that of the admit card before taking his/her )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 273.058 Td 0.000 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(signature. Legal action will be taken against the applicant if any irregularity is detected.)] TJ ET
BT 38.507 260.900 Td /F3 7.5 Tf  [(12)] TJ ET
BT 55.119 260.900 Td 0.214 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(Applicant will be expelled if the general instructions are not followed or if found guilty of misconduct, misbehaviour or adopting unfair means. Applicant found )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 251.743 Td 0.240 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(guilty of copying, adopting any type of unfair means or misconduct will be barred from applying in any future examination conducted by the Commission and )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 242.585 Td 0.382 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(will not be allowed to apply for any other posts to be advertised by the Commission. Moreover, he/she may be handed over to the law enforcing agency for )] TJ ET
BT 55.119 233.428 Td 0.000 Tw /F3 7.5 Tf  [(taking legal action against him/her.)] TJ ET
